    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41575" root="وت" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتٌّ</span></b>  (L, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُتٌّ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُتَّةٌ</span> (K) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتَّةٌ</span> (L)
The <i>cry of the bird called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرَشَان</span>. (AA, L, K.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْتَى</span> signifies He cried as cries the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ورشان</span>.
(IAar, L.)

